<title>
Rear Floor Rear Panel (Partial) Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Rear skirt panel: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9B06018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFJA0P9B0116.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.192mm" ver = "01" gw = "227" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06019001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Mark at the shown position and cut rear floor panel.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
You may accidentally cut the parts under the rear floor rear panel when cutting the rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Take sufficient care not to damage the parts under the rear floor rear panel when cutting rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove rear floor rear panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<title>
2WD model
</title>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A9B0049.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "192.855mm" ver = "01" gw = "434" gh = "530"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<title>
4WD model
</title>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A9B0050.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "192.556mm" ver = "01" gw = "458" gh = "529"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Except E02 and E22 model
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
