</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06019002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s). 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9B04009"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<s1 page = "1">
<ptxt>
For 2WD model, install rear floor rear panel as follows.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Install new rear floor rear panel to vehicle body and cut in stacked condition.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Install towing hook bracket and rear floor inner reinforcement or spare tire bracket.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Conduct continuous weld.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of continuous weld part.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A9B0051.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "232.311mm" ver = "03" gw = "496" gh = "642"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[C]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Without spare tire
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[D]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
With spare tire
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For 4WD model, install rear floor rear panel as follows.
</ptxt>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Overlap rear floor panel supplied as service part onto rear floor panel that is attached to vehicle body.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Conduct fillet weld.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of fillet weld part.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>
Apply body sealer to fillet weld portions (
<symbol name = "MASTAR_W" width = "5.006mm" height = "3.006mm"/>
) of rear floor panel and smooth out sealant.
</ptxt>
</s2>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A9B0052.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "192.120mm" ver = "01" gw = "462" gh = "528"/>
<callout>
